# NOTE: wix/models/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It was ignored until 2026-09-11, which silently excluded every new model and texture
# added there. That is exactly why 49 textures referenced by the viewer's FBX files were
# never committed and five of fourteen assets rendered untextured on the live site.
# The directory holds the site's real 3D assets, is served by GitHub Pages, and its
# current size (149 MB) is well inside the 1 GB Pages limit. Do not re-add this rule.
